[00:02] [scene:ui]
VISUAL: A close-up of the Insta360 camera screen showing a live performance. A crowd at a concert, holding light sticks.
AUDIO: 'When the stage lights up, don’t miss a moment. Insta360 Luna Ultra. Your next concert essential. Bring every moment closer. Way up in the stands? No problem.'

[00:15] [scene:demo]
VISUAL: A singer on stage with "12.0x" zoom displayed, and text "Pro-Grade Telephoto Lens Up to 15x HighRes Zoom". A wide shot of a concert stage and audience.
AUDIO: 'The Pro-Grade Telephoto Lens now goes further with 15× HighRes Zoom. Zoom in and stay crisp. Wanna zoom further? The brand-new Ultra Telephoto Lens boosts your existing zoom by 1.5×. Reach up to 22.5× magnification,'

[00:31] [scene:scene]
VISUAL: A singer performing on stage with a band and audience. A singer on stage with text "AI-Enhanced Stage Footage" and description "Sharper details, balanced exposure, and vivid colors."
AUDIO: 'and capture footage from the crowd. Worried about tricky stage lighting or camera shake? Turn on Stage Mode for polished footage in one tap. Keeps highlights under control and colors true to life.'

[00:43] [scene:scene]
VISUAL: A concert scene with a singer and audience. Hands holding a smartphone recording a concert.
AUDIO: 'See it as it happened. Performers move, but Luna keeps up. Turn on Active Zoom Tracking to keep your subject in frame. Stay in the moment.'

[00:59] [scene:scene]
VISUAL: A person in the audience holding the Insta360 camera. A singer on stage with text "Live Frame Snapshots" and description "Capture Live Frame photos while recording."
AUDIO: 'Let Luna handle the shot. Capture a Live Frame with one tap while recording. to make every highlight last. And the audio is just as good.'

[01:14] [scene:ui]
VISUAL: A singer on stage in vertical video format, with text "4K30fps Vertical Video" and description "Shoot ready-to-share content." A scenic view of mountains and trees.
AUDIO: 'Switch to Stage Audio for clear vocals and reduced background noise. Shoot in 4K Vertical Video for share-ready content. Super telephoto. And so much more.'

[01:26] [scene:ui]
VISUAL: The Insta360 camera screen showing a landscape view with "22.5x" zoom indicated. Black screen with white text "Think bold."
AUDIO: 'Bring distant landscapes and unforgettable travel moments closer. Insta360 Luna Ultra. Zoom further. Get closer.'
